    prompt+="\n## Your Mission\n"
    prompt+="1. **Find the open PR** for this item. Try these approaches:\n"
    prompt+="   - Run: \`gh pr list --head $item_worktree_branch\` (if branch is known)\n"
    prompt+="   - Run: \`gh pr list --search \"$item_id\" --state open\`\n"
    prompt+="   - Run: \`gh pr list --state open\` and look for a matching PR\n"
    prompt+="\n2. **QA Testing Checklist** — run all applicable checks:\n"
    prompt+="   - **Lint validation**: Run platform-specific lint (swiftlint, ktlintCheck, npm run lint, etc.)\n"
    prompt+="   - **Unit tests**: Run the test suite and verify all tests pass\n"
    prompt+="   - **Build verification**: Confirm the project compiles/builds without errors\n"
    prompt+="   - **Manual feature testing**: Exercise the affected features end-to-end\n"
    prompt+="   - **Edge cases and error paths**: Test boundary conditions and failure scenarios\n"
    prompt+="   - **Regression check**: Verify no regressions in related functionality\n"
    prompt+="\n3. **Check the diff thoroughly:**\n"
    prompt+="   \`\`\`bash\n"
    prompt+="   gh pr diff <number>\n"
    prompt+="   \`\`\`\n"
    prompt+="\n4. **Submit your test result** using gh-bot-test (NOT gh pr review):\n"
    prompt+="   \`\`\`bash\n"
    prompt+="   # To approve (all tests pass):\n"
    prompt+="   gh-bot-test --pr <number> --event APPROVE --body \"Tests pass - <summary of what was verified>\"\n"
    prompt+="\n"
